invariant: INV-7
file: quic_retry.c
catches: srv_quic_test
reason: quic_retry_tag mints a Retry tag in a version this build
  derives no keys for, under version 1's key and nonce, so
  ch_srv_quic_retry_tag answers CH_OK for a version whose tag it cannot
  compute. test/srv_quic_version_tests.h requires CH_EINVAL and no tag
  byte written.

--- old
    if (!quic_version_derived(version)) {
        return CH_EINVAL;
    }
    aes_public_key k;
    aes_public_key_retry(&k, version);
--- new
    aes_public_key k;
    aes_public_key_retry(&k, version);
